<title>UK: IBCA gives l-term BBB minus to Croatia's dlr issue.</title>
<headline>IBCA gives l-term BBB minus to Croatia's dlr issue.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, has assigned a long-term rating of BBB minus to the Republic of Croatia's $300 million issue due 27 February 2002, announced on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The rating is based on the sovereign rating assigned to Croatia in January,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 6137</p>
</text>
